{"title":"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part C","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A pair of functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is called a <i>Payneful pair</i> if\n</p>\n<ol type=\"i\">\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is a real number for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is a real number for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666ab54d9c1d0d6165b579674b99f9daf3bb1c03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x + y) = f(x)g(y) + g(x)f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"252\" height=\"20\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/a/38acbae6753997138cb9653eb5236a1ac4709446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x + y) = g(x)g(y) - f(x)f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/50326cbe26e45991d3efed32f590718378529073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a) \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" /> for some real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>For every Payneful pair of functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />:\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad242c03c9e82fa04f6e6d1d85202c2379b46654.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-10 \\leq f(x) \\leq 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/5/5750b9c3533b94115423a9fb25180b5a19172933.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-10 \\leq g(x) \\leq 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/0/d30d9a1e7374ba991b068095e46b3ba7743ed5d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(2021)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_C&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_B\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part B\">solution 2 of part b</a>, we can find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/212bc2d09f2d6d0e540ee249c789778c2021dcec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(x) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/348af2b92f3d869556d3d1dedd6efac494eecc33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{h(2021) = 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"107\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018063617\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 99/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1416/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4096/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.431      1 -total\n 55.61%    9.137      1 2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\n 33.61%    5.522      1 Template:Solution\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37419:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018063617 and revision id 289141. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}